# Build / Executables
# NOTE: *.spec is intentionally tracked now, not ignored -- FPL Dashboard.spec
# and run_pipeline.spec are the source-of-truth recipes PyInstaller needs to
# rebuild the .exe launchers, so they should live in version control like any
# other source file. Only the generated build output stays ignored:
dist/
build/

